<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Repel Greater Undead</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Spell Tier: 2
Class: Necromancer (guild level 31)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>cast repel greater undead</a>
</pre>
<p>The caster raises a hand and shouts 'Mes muert dislux', and every undead 
creature in the room that the caster can see is filled with fear. While 
the fear lasts, every half minute in a fight there is a chance it flees. 
The better your spell, the longer it lasts: from a minute up to several 
minutes. Nothing else in the room is touched.
</p><p>An undead that resists is not afraid, and attacks the caster instead. It 
can be cast while fighting, and no free hands are needed. It is also found 
on wands, staffs and scrolls. Repel lesser undead does the same to one 
undead.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Repel Lesser Undead</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Fear</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Divine Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>